2026-07-27T09:30:59.0746572Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:30:59.0747065Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:30:59.0747834Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:30:59.0748981Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:30:59.0750515Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
